{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1000_p", "source_sha256": "2fc6aaee33e7bc7a0a1b05668a7a125f0499c677a92399a7b5e4205f4b7e04c0", "ja": "（今日は春香と新曲リリース記念のお渡し会に行く\n予定だ。出発は午後からだし、事務仕事でもするかな）", "zh": "（今天计划和春香一起去参加新歌发售纪念的交接会。下午才出发，先处理一下事务工作吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1001_001har", "source_sha256": "cecda962579f032e5eb1a3f46576466d7ad61e2a63d07a95507eba1c0547a631", "ja": "わぁっ！　遅刻遅刻っ！　あっ、\n{$P$}さん、おはようございます！", "zh": "哇啊！要迟到要迟到了！啊，\n{$P$}先生，早上好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1002_p", "source_sha256": "72465b7a18b27eb4e51731651043a60ba70c2bb3363d4ac547714ef29ee28195", "ja": "おはよう、春香。ずいぶん急いでるみたいだな。\nあれ？　午前中レッスンでも入れてたっけ。", "zh": "早上好，春香。看起来你挺着急的啊。\n咦？上午安排了课程来着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1003_001har", "source_sha256": "9fbe649efd5236118dbb2813b14903ba34c4891f90f56a00e1827002cebf1064", "ja": "えっ？\nあはは、やだなぁ{$P$}さん。", "zh": "诶？\n啊哈哈，真是的，{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1004_001har", "source_sha256": "809ee3423fd1e070c2e914a76379be4d74172c1d5da266b398033417f9b67907", "ja": "もしかして忘れてるんですか？\n今日は私の、新曲のお渡し会の日じゃないですか♪", "zh": "该不会是忘了吗？\n今天可是我的新歌签售会呀♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b6edabf65cc18df0d69e23d48c6278b58a0e8d300bef342dcc6bdeb13c032872", "ja": "うん、それはそうなんだけど……。あれ？\nお渡し会は午後からって、伝えてなかったか？", "zh": "嗯，确实是这样……咦？  \n我没告诉过你，交接会是从下午开始的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1006_001har", "source_sha256": "c8e4ed22d5ced9bb8aad2c2fa894a0746a5802fde4acbe9d9fcad48fea31c512", "ja": "え……？　あっ、あああっ！　うわー……。\nごめんなさい、忘れてたのは私でした……。", "zh": "诶……？啊、啊啊啊！呜哇……  \n对不起，忘记这件事的是我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1007_001har", "source_sha256": "40b518c5a7b6104389aa89c8b6525ba60c4f68d2178f467c02ca2217d5022e04", "ja": "起きたらいつもより遅い時間だったから、それで\n慌てて……。うう、寝ぼけちゃったのかな……。", "zh": "醒来的时候已经比平时晚了，所以就慌慌张张的……呜呜，我是不是还迷迷糊糊的啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1008_p", "source_sha256": "506abc81ee38137ca881253c4d271921f3fea91806ddd62453e2524a32891e35", "ja": "まあまあ、疲れてたんだよ。せっかくだから、\n午前中はゆっくりしたらいいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "好了好了，你只是太累了。难得有机会，上午就悠闲地休息一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1009_001har", "source_sha256": "29d2d1079005338fd987c60cee850baced710090127dbf023d4a5aecf44ded62", "ja": "はい！　あっ、そうだ。\n私、昨日の夜、いーっぱいクッキーを焼いたんです♪", "zh": "好的！啊，对了。\n我昨晚烤了好多好多曲奇♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1010_001har", "source_sha256": "c2cee2730cdb7d12da19496ef4f488df1155ae2a5529bf6cfa04ba83032eff71", "ja": "現場の皆さんにって思ってたくさん作ったんですけど、\n{$P$}さんの分は別にしてますから。", "zh": "本来是想给现场的大家，所以做了很多，不过{$P$}先生的那份我单独留出来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1011_001har", "source_sha256": "15cd312301d52e0b649bc33580446cb1e37245d3a92ae722a57e96a446f31a7d", "ja": "よければこの後、紅茶でも飲みながら……ふぁ、\n一緒に食べませんか？　眠気覚ましにもなるかも……。", "zh": "可以的话，待会儿要不要一边喝红茶……哈欠，\n一边吃呢？也许还能提提神……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e156fab75fa3753dc6e3ce8a21976a23acea2a27fc0118a15d324112481d8a86", "ja": "おお、ありがとう。別に俺は眠くないけど……ん？　\nもしかして、これを焼いてて……夜更かししたな？", "zh": "哦哦，谢谢。我倒是不困……嗯？\n难道是烤这个熬夜了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1013_001har", "source_sha256": "0a0835db94f921904f86d744679c4b9de1701f3d0bed5d2fc57dc1490fc3c63d", "ja": "あ、あはは……。こ、紅茶でも淹れてこようかなっ。\nいってきま～す！　……って、あわわっ、わぁ！？", "zh": "啊，啊哈哈……要、要不我去泡杯红茶吧。\n我这就去～！……哇啊，呀！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c37618957cc4621416df16c49bfe1a8db9d119b6c1abb78eeca67670b6d242c9", "ja": "春香っ！？", "zh": "春香！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1015_null", "source_sha256": "becbc74e492dce5e1ef7636f1bb07d7c74e2917e91cec49fb826d7623550f7a8", "ja": "お渡し会・会場", "zh": "赠送会・会场", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1016_fun1", "source_sha256": "45b453978ff453464294da21375914cefd90137a3d63e2ef7a386c9c444ce01d", "ja": "い、いつも応援してます！　実はわたし、アイドルに\nなりたくて……。憧れが、春香ちゃんなんです！", "zh": "我、我一直都在为你加油！其实，我想成为偶像……\n我憧憬的对象就是春香！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1017_001har", "source_sha256": "4e511e74c4b17a7d06ea628937b248a90e3224b2295e1ad98d44d1cfb7d5efe1", "ja": "わっ、本当！？　すっごく嬉しい！\nいつか一緒のステージに立てるといいね♪", "zh": "哇，真的吗！？太开心了！\n要是将来能站在同一个舞台上就好了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1018_fun1", "source_sha256": "509f044f44939450179be63697a0d8de1c241c1436061741c518d1edfa0d1ffd", "ja": "はいっ！　あっ……でも、わたし、すごく不器用で。\nこんなわたしでも、アイドルになれるかな……？", "zh": "好的！啊……不过，我真的很笨手笨脚。\n像我这样，也能成为偶像吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1019_001har", "source_sha256": "bacfb8d527e406ba92616a17d16122034a3b18092e802e4bea067374578ab812", "ja": "うん、もちろん！　だって私も、すごくドジで\nおっちょこちょいなんだよ。実は、今日もね……。", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！因为我也笨手笨脚的，\n经常冒冒失失呢。其实，今天也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1020_001har", "source_sha256": "31cfca0cc6b03bf6268e4456c6354daae16c76517098c8becc2844a448ceb13c", "ja": "……なんてことがあって。ふふっ。だから大丈夫、\n頑張ろう！　アイドルって、すっごく楽しいよ♪", "zh": "……就发生了这种事。呵呵。所以没事的，\n加油吧！当偶像真的超级开心哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1021_p", "source_sha256": "ea59cff8439a579c1bbb2c080ddbc1a4c9f2fe27e3e1f788a05e980167946eb4", "ja": "（春香の持つ親しみやすさと輝きは、\nこれからも沢山の人の心を掴んでいくことだろう）", "zh": "（春香那份亲切感与光芒，今后一定也会俘获许多人的心吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_001har0234_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_001har0234_1022_p", "source_sha256": "053cea2192feac8cd728f409f6ae4b52ae8cd9a2a22476f53f64582779b8cfdb", "ja": "（そんな春香の成長を一番近くで支えていけるのは、\nとても幸運なことなのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（能在离春香最近的地方支持她成长，或许是一件非常幸运的事吧）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
